# Build context of deploy/cloud/Dockerfile: the Rust workspace, the dashboard and its workspace
# packages, and this directory. Nothing else.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!vendor
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages
!apps/dashboard
!deploy/cloud/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/cloud/health.sh
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.roll
**/.test-build
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# Public CA certificates the code bundles (include_str!), not secrets.
!crates/roll-edge/src/cloudflare-origin-pull-ca.pem
